# std/merge's image (design/caos-expr.md, Phase 3): this directory is a flake
# (flake.nix + flake.lock + worker), so its image is the flake-builder applied
# to the directory itself. It names the builder by a LOCAL deep-deps mount
# (DEEP-DEPS/flake-builder, declared in DEPS) rather than /std/flake-builder, so
# std carries no ambient self-reference. Resolving `/cas/std/merge` evaluates
# this expression — the flake→image step made explicit rather than left to the
# server's implicit flake detection.
run DEEP-DEPS/flake-builder -- --in:@=.
